    "Id": "chassisdef_dyrnwyn_DYR-B",
    "Name": "Dyrnwyn",
    "Details": "The B configuration of the Dyrnwyn OmniMech is a general-purpose loadout, using four ER Medium Lasers to apply damage and a Micro Pulse Laser for anti-infantry work. Additional heat sinks and a cooling pod handle the heat load from the lasers, and a Nova CEWS provides electronic warfare. Like every Dyrnwyn, it relies on jump jets and its split partial wings, which give greater control in the air and fold up for transport.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
